Cell["\<\
\\left\\{\\frac{\\frac{\\text{mPsiT}^2 \\epsilon  \\left(36 \
y_{\\text{DM}}{}^2 x_t+12 (3-2 x) y_{\\text{DM}}{}^2-x \\lambda
   _s\\right)}{y_{\\text{DM}}{}^2}-\\frac{\\text{mPsiT}^2 x \\lambda \
_s}{y_{\\text{DM}}{}^2}+\\frac{\\text{mPsiT}^2 x \\epsilon  \\lambda _s \\log
   (x)}{y_{\\text{DM}}{}^2}+\\frac{12 \\epsilon  \\log \
\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\lambda }+x_t-x+1}{2 \\sqrt{x_t}}\\right) \
\\left(\\left(x_t^3-(x+1)
   x_t^2-(x+1)^2 x_t+(x-1)^2 (x+1)\\right) \\left(\\text{mPsiT}^2 \
x-\\text{p}_2.\\text{p}_2\\right) \\sqrt{\\lambda -4 \\lambda  x_t}+\\lambda
   ^{3/2} \\text{mPsiT}^2 x \\sqrt{1-4 x_t} \
\\left(x_t-x+1\\right)\\right)}{\\lambda  x^2 \\sqrt{1-4 x_t}}+\\frac{12 \
\\epsilon 
   \\left(x_t+x+1\\right) \\left(\\text{mPsiT}^2 \
x-\\text{p}_2.\\text{p}_2\\right) \\sqrt{\\lambda  \\left(x_t^2-2 (x+1)
   x_t+(x-1)^2\\right)}}{\\lambda  x}+24 \\text{mPsiT}^2 x_t+24 \
\\text{mPsiT}^2+\\frac{6 \\epsilon  \\log \\left(x_t\\right) \
\\left(\\text{mPsiT}^5 x
   \\left((x-1)^2-x_t \\left(x_t+2 x\\right)\\right)-\\frac{\\text{mPsiT}^3 \
\\left(x_t^2+x^2-1\\right) \\left(\\text{mPsiT}^2
   x-\\text{p}_2.\\text{p}_2\\right) \\sqrt{-\\lambda  \\left(4 x_t-1\\right) \
\\left(x_t^2-2 (x+1) x_t+(x-1)^2\\right)}}{\\lambda  \\sqrt{1-4
   x_t}}\\right)}{\\text{mPsiT}^3 x^2}-12 \\text{p}_2.\\text{p}_2}{64 \\pi ^4 \
g_s}\\right\\}\
\>", "Output",
