   y_{\\text{DM}}{}^2 x_t+12 (3-2 x) y_{\\text{DM}}{}^2-x \\lambda _s\\right)\
\\right)+12 \\text{mPsiT}^3 y_{\\text{DM}}{}^2 \\log
   \\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\lambda }+x_t-x+1}{2 \\sqrt{x_t}}\\right) \
