   \\left(x_t-x+1\\right)\\right)-6 y_{\\text{DM}}{}^2 \\log \
\\left(x_t\\right) \\left(\\lambda  \\text{mPsiT}^5 x \\sqrt{1-4 x_t} \
\\left(x_t^2+2 x
   x_t-(x-1)^2\\right)+\\text{mPsiT}^3 \\left(x_t^2+x^2-1\\right) \
